  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Stimpy invents the Gametron 5000 Moneymaker which is the first video game machine in the world that rewards the player with money. Ren, who is always on the lookout to get rich, eagerly gets to playing with the video game system on the quest to earn big bucks. \n\nIn the game, you control Ren & Stimpy through various side scrolling levels which are based on different episodes of the cartoon show.  Episodes the levels are based on are Space Madness,Out West, and Robin Hoek. \n\nIn Space Madness, Space Cadet Stimpy must get a dazed Ren to the sick bay to feed him some chicken soup to cure him of his space madness. You will guide Ren through the Space Diner, the Laboratory, the Button Room and the Zero Gravity Bathroom to get to the sick bay. There are also parts of this level in which you will control the spacecraft that involves side scrolling shoot em up gameplay.\n\nOut West pits Three-Fingered Hoek and Stimpy the Kid, in the role of horse thieves. You must guide the buckeroos through the outskirts of town, past the corrals, through the rusty frontier town and to the stables, where you'll find the sheriff's horse to steal.\n\nDuring Robin Hoek, Ren is the finest archer in all of Logwood Forest. Armed with trusty bow and turkey baster, you must make your way through the village and rescue the fair Maid Moron from the clutches of the evil sheriff, who is holding the maiden captive in his castle."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "The Ren & Stimpy Show: Buckeroo$! est un jeu de plateforme développé par Imagineering Inc. sur NES. Howard Phillips a agi en tant que producteur exécutif.\nL'histoire du jeu commence avec Stimpy fabriquant quelque chose dans son laboratoire. Cette nouvelle invention s'avère être le Gametron 5000 Moneymaker, une machine qui vous donne de l'argent pour chaque jeu vidéo que vous complétez. Stimpy parle à Ren de sa nouvelle invention, et ils s'assoient tous deux et essaient de terminer chaque match."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Stimpy erfindet den Gametron 5000 Moneymaker, den ersten Videospielautomaten der Welt, der den Spieler mit Geld belohnt. Ren, der immer auf der Suche nach Reichtum ist, beginnt eifrig mit dem Videospielsystem zu spielen, um das große Geld zu verdienen.\r\n\r\nIm Spiel steuerst du Ren & Stimpy durch verschiedene seitlich scrollende Level, die auf verschiedenen Episoden der Zeichentrickserie basieren. Die Episoden, auf denen die Levels basieren, sind Space Madness, Out West und Robin Hoek."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Stimpy inventa el Gametron 5000 Moneymaker, que es la primera máquina de videojuegos del mundo que recompensa al jugador con dinero. Ren, que siempre está atento para hacerse rico, comienza a jugar con entusiasmo con el sistema de videojuegos en la búsqueda de ganar mucho dinero.\r\nEn el juego, controlas Ren y Stimpy a través de varios niveles de desplazamiento lateral que se basan en diferentes episodios de la serie de dibujos animados. Los episodios en los que se basan los niveles son Space Madness, Out West y Robin Hoek."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Remote Control è stato un programma televisivo prodotto da MTV per cinque stagioni dal 1987 al 1990. È stato il primo programma non legato alla musica di MTV.\r\nGrazie al loro telecomando, tre concorrenti scelgono tra 9 canali tematici orientati alla cultura pop. Devono poi rispondere alle domande del canale scegliendo tra le tre risposte proposte."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "The Ren & Stimpy Show: Buckeroo $! é um jogo de plataforma desenvolvido pela Imagineering Inc. no NES. Howard Phillips atuou como produtor executivo. A história do jogo começa com Stimpy fazendo algo em seu laboratório. Essa nova invenção acabou sendo o Gametron 5000 Moneymaker, uma máquina que dá dinheiro para cada videogame concluído. Stimpy conta a Ren sobre sua nova invenção, e os dois se sentam e tentam terminar cada partida."
    }
  ],
